<div id="q-store-backup" class="question" data-requirement-id="SE-3a">
  <h3>5. How will data and metadata be stored and backed up during the research process?</h3>

  <div class="answer">
    {# Data stored by members (no shared workspace) #}
    {%- set sharedWorkspacePath = [uuids.processingCUuid, uuids.sharedWorkspaceQUuid]|reply_path -%}
    {%- set sharedWorkspaceAUuid = repliesMap[sharedWorkspacePath]|reply_str_value -%}
    <div class="workspace-policy dataset-policy">
    {%- if sharedWorkspaceAUuid == uuids.sharedWorkspaceNoAUuid -%}
      <p data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="working-storage-arrangement" data-status="complete">There is no shared workspace used during the project for working with data.</p>
      {%- set notSharedBackupPath = [sharedWorkspacePath, uuids.sharedWorkspaceNoAUuid, uuids.notSharedBackupQUuid]|reply_path -%}
      {%- set notSharedBackupAUuid = repliesMap[notSharedBackupPath]|reply_str_value -%}
      {%- if notSharedBackupAUuid == uuids.notSharedBackupYesAUuid -%}
        <p data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="backup-reliability" data-status="complete">Data that project members themselves store are adequately backed up and traceable. Therefore data are protected against both equipment failure and human error.</p>
      {%- elif notSharedBackupAUuid == uuids.notSharedBackupNoAUuid -%}
        <p data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="backup-reliability" data-status="explicit-no">Data stored by individual project members are not yet adequately backed up and traceable.</p>
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="reading-gap"><p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="backup-reliability" data-status="missing"><strong>Information not provided:</strong> whether data stored by individual project members are adequately backed up and traceable.</p></div>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- elif sharedWorkspaceAUuid == uuids.sharedWorkspaceYesAUuid -%}
      <p data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="working-storage-arrangement" data-status="complete">There is a shared workspace used during the project for working with data.</p>
      {% set specialists = repliesMap[[sharedWorkspacePath, uuids.sharedWorkspaceYesAUuid, uuids.sharedSpecialistsQUuid]|reply_path]|reply_str_value %}
      {% if specialists == uuids.sharedSpecialistsYesAUuid %}
        <p data-fact-id="workspace-management" data-status="complete">Dedicated specialists will operate the shared workspace.</p>
      {% elif specialists == uuids.sharedSpecialistsNoAUuid %}
        <p data-fact-id="workspace-management" data-status="explicit-no">The shared workspace will not be operated by dedicated specialists.</p>
      {% endif %}
      {%- set sharedHowPath = [sharedWorkspacePath, uuids.sharedWorkspaceYesAUuid, uuids.sharedHowQUuid]|reply_path -%}
      {%- set sharedHowAUuid = repliesMap[sharedHowPath]|reply_str_value -%}
      {%- if sharedHowAUuid == uuids.sharedHowExploreAUuid -%}
        {%- set sharedHowChangePath = [sharedHowPath, uuids.sharedHowExploreAUuid, uuids.sharedHowChangeQUuid]|reply_path -%}
        {%- set sharedHowChangeAUuid = repliesMap[sharedHowChangePath]|reply_str_value -%}
        {%- if sharedHowChangeAUuid == uuids.sharedHowChangeSameAUuid -%}
          <p data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="storage-capacity" data-status="complete">Storage needs will be the same during the whole project.</p>
        {%- elif sharedHowChangeAUuid == uuids.sharedHowChangeLargeAUuid -%}
          <p data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="storage-capacity" data-status="complete">Storage needs are large at the beginning and will be reduced later.</p>
        {%- elif sharedHowChangeAUuid == uuids.sharedHowChangeSmallAUuid -%}
          <p data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="storage-capacity" data-status="complete">Storage needs are small at the beginning and will grow later.</p>
        {%- elif sharedHowChangeAUuid == uuids.sharedHowChangeMiddleAUuid -%}
          <p data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="storage-capacity" data-status="complete">Storage needs are largest in the middle of the project.</p>
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="reading-gap"><p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="storage-capacity" data-status="missing"><strong>Information not provided:</strong> how storage capacity needs will change during the project.</p></div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="reading-gap"><p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="storage-capacity" data-status="missing"><strong>Information not provided:</strong> how storage capacity needs will change during the project.</p></div>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- set sharedReliablePath = [sharedWorkspacePath, uuids.sharedWorkspaceYesAUuid, uuids.sharedReliableQUuid]|reply_path -%}
      {%- set sharedReliableAUuid = repliesMap[sharedReliablePath]|reply_str_value -%}
      {%- if sharedReliableAUuid == uuids.sharedReliableExploreAUuid -%}
        {%- set sharedReliablePreventLossPath = [sharedReliablePath, uuids.sharedReliableExploreAUuid, uuids.sharedReliablePreventLossQUuid]|reply_path -%}
        {%- set sharedReliablePreventLossAUuid = repliesMap[sharedReliablePreventLossPath]|reply_str_value -%}
        {%- set sharedReliableBackupPath = [sharedReliablePath, uuids.sharedReliableExploreAUuid, uuids.sharedReliableBackupQUuid]|reply_path -%}
        {%- set sharedReliableBackupAUuid = repliesMap[sharedReliableBackupPath]|reply_str_value -%}
        {%- if sharedReliablePreventLossAUuid == uuids.sharedReliablePreventLossSufficientAUuid %}
          <p data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="loss-prevention" data-status="complete">The workspace provides sufficient safeguards against a total loss of data.</p>
        {%- elif sharedReliablePreventLossAUuid == uuids.sharedReliablePreventLossStoredAUuid %}
          <p data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="loss-prevention" data-status="complete">All essential data will also be stored elsewhere to prevent a total loss of data.</p>
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="reading-gap"><p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="loss-prevention" data-status="missing"><strong>Information not provided:</strong> how a total loss of data will be prevented.</p></div>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if sharedReliableBackupAUuid == uuids.sharedReliableBackupCopyLeftAUuid %}
          <p data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="backup-arrangement" data-status="complete">Project participants are responsible for backing up project data stored outside the workspace.</p>
        {%- elif sharedReliableBackupAUuid == uuids.sharedReliableBackupCopyNoDataAUuid %}
          <p data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="backup-arrangement" data-status="complete">Data are stored only in the workspace, so no additional copies of files outside the workspace need to be backed up.</p>
        {%- elif sharedReliableBackupAUuid == uuids.sharedReliableBackupCopyAllSomewhereAUuid %}
          <p data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="backup-arrangement" data-status="complete">All project data stored outside the workspace will be adequately backed up.</p>
        {%- elif sharedReliableBackupAUuid == uuids.sharedReliableBackupCopyBackupsAUuid %}
          <p data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="backup-arrangement" data-status="complete">We will make automated backups of all data stored outside the workspace.</p>
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="reading-gap"><p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="backup-arrangement" data-status="missing"><strong>Information not provided:</strong> how data in and outside the shared workspace will be backed up.</p></div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="reading-gap"><p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="loss-prevention" data-status="missing"><strong>Information not provided:</strong> how a total loss of data will be prevented.</p></div>
        <div class="reading-gap"><p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="backup-arrangement" data-status="missing"><strong>Information not provided:</strong> how data in and outside the shared workspace will be backed up.</p></div>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- else -%}
      <div class="reading-gap"><p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="working-storage-arrangement" data-status="missing"><strong>Information not provided:</strong> whether data will be kept in a shared workspace or by individual project members.</p></div>
      <div class="reading-gap"><p class="data-gap" data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="backup-arrangement" data-status="missing"><strong>Information not provided:</strong> how project data and metadata will be backed up.</p></div>
    {%- endif -%}
    </div>
    {# Cold archival DURING research is independent of the shared workspace. #}
    {% set archivePath = [uuids.preservingCUuid, uuids.archivedDuringQUuid]|reply_path %}
    {% set archive = repliesMap[archivePath]|reply_str_value %}
    {% set remoteKnown = false %}
    {% set frequencyKnown = false %}
    {% if archive == uuids.archivedDuringYesAUuid %}
      <h4>Archival during the project</h4>
      <div class="archive-location-policy dataset-policy">
      <p data-fact-id="during-project-archive" data-status="complete">Data will be archived in cold storage during the project.</p>
      {% set archivePrefix = [archivePath, uuids.archivedDuringYesAUuid]|reply_path %}
      {% set medium = repliesMap[[archivePrefix, uuids.archiveMediumQUuid]|reply_path]|reply_str_value %}
      {% if medium == uuids.archiveMediumDiskAUuid %}
        <p data-fact-id="archive-medium" data-status="complete">The archive will be stored on disk.</p>
      {% elif medium == uuids.archiveMediumTapeAUuid %}
        <p data-fact-id="archive-medium" data-status="complete">The archive will be stored on tape.</p>
      {% elif medium == uuids.archiveMediumOtherAUuid %}
        <p data-fact-id="archive-medium" data-status="partial">The archive will use a medium other than disk or tape.</p>
      {% endif %}
      {% set remote = repliesMap[[archivePrefix, uuids.archiveRemoteQUuid]|reply_path]|reply_str_value %}
      {% set remoteKnown = remote in [uuids.archiveRemoteYesAUuid, uuids.archiveRemoteNoAUuid] %}
      {% if remote == uuids.archiveRemoteYesAUuid %}
        <p data-fact-id="archive-remote-location" data-status="complete">The archive will be stored at a remote location.</p>
      {% elif remote == uuids.archiveRemoteNoAUuid %}
        <p data-fact-id="archive-remote-location" data-status="explicit-no">The archive will not be stored at a remote location.</p>
      {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% set changesPath = [archivePrefix, uuids.archivedDuringReQUuid]|reply_path %}
      {% set changes = repliesMap[changesPath]|reply_str_value %}
      {% if changes == uuids.archivedDuringReNoAUuid %}
        <p data-fact-id="archive-changes" data-status="explicit-no">The archived data is not expected to change over time.</p>
      {% elif changes == uuids.archivedDuringReYesAUuid %}
        <div class="archive-recovery-policy dataset-policy">
        <p data-fact-id="archive-changes" data-status="complete">Changes to archived data will require re-archival.</p>
        {% set changingPrefix = [changesPath, uuids.archivedDuringReYesAUuid]|reply_path %}
        {% set frequent = repliesMap[[changingPrefix, uuids.archivedDuringReFrequentBackupsQUuid]|reply_path]|reply_str_value %}
        {% set frequencyKnown = frequent in [uuids.archivedDuringReFrequentBackupsYesAUuid, uuids.archivedDuringReFrequentBackupsNoAUuid] %}
        {% if frequent == uuids.archivedDuringReFrequentBackupsYesAUuid %}
          <p data-fact-id="archive-frequent-backup-need" data-status="complete">Frequent backups are required because the archived data changes frequently.</p>
        {% elif frequent == uuids.archivedDuringReFrequentBackupsNoAUuid %}
          <p data-fact-id="archive-frequent-backup-need" data-status="explicit-no">Frequent backups are not required because the archived data changes infrequently.</p>
        {% endif %}
        {% set recovery = repliesMap[[changingPrefix, uuids.archivedDuringRelyQUuid]|reply_path]|reply_str_value %}
        {% if recovery == uuids.archivedDuringRelyYesAUuid %}
          <p data-fact-id="archive-human-error-recovery" data-status="complete">These backups will be used to recover from accidental changes or deletions.</p>
        {% elif recovery == uuids.archivedDuringRelyNoAUuid %}
          <p data-fact-id="archive-human-error-recovery" data-status="explicit-no">These backups will not be relied on to recover from accidental changes or deletions.</p>
        {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    {% elif archive == uuids.archivedDuringNoAUuid %}
      <p data-fact-id="during-project-archive" data-status="explicit-no">Data will not be archived in cold storage during the project.</p>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="data-gap template-gap storage-detail-limits">
    <p>The fields mapped by this template are insufficient to establish the following operational details:</p>
      <ul>
        <li data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="storage-location" data-status="{{ 'partial' if remoteKnown else 'unmapped' }}">Exact working-storage and backup locations are not established by these mapped answers.</li>
        <li data-requirement-id="SE-3a" data-fact-id="backup-frequency" data-status="{{ 'partial' if frequencyKnown else 'unmapped' }}">An actual backup schedule is not established by these mapped answers; a need for frequent backups is not a schedule.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
